{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"f10ba1c08427ebf1","type":"group","x":-1200,"y":-900,"width":1855,"height":1220,"color":"3","label":"第二幕"},
		{"id":"1ec1e17602dce056","type":"text","text":"━━━ 第二幕 ━━━劝降反被劝","x":-701,"y":-905,"width":500,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"7583ce51d7db4a35","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20260729022123.png","x":-1101,"y":-845,"width":400,"height":267},
		{"id":"a331eaeab923b6f1","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20260729022136.png","x":-1160,"y":-482,"width":400,"height":263},
		{"id":"392b788479185fe8","type":"text","text":"## SCENE 1：胡逸飞劝降\n方志敏被押进来，脸上身上全是伤，囚服破烂，血在滴。\n\n---\n\n\n","x":149,"y":-845,"width":430,"height":125},
		{
			"id":"d2db4168cac6ef13",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"插入《清贫》画面\n风格：\n场景： 火红的战场\n行为：两个国民党士兵在战场树林掠夺搜身方志敏。\n国民党士兵外貌描述：\n构图：\n共产党方志敏外貌服装描述：灰扑扑的共产党服装（具体样貌？）\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-710,
			"y":-280,
			"width":400,
			"height":240,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{"id":"7c2a4153b5adc3fd","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20260729022142.png","x":-1160,"y":-219,"width":400,"height":263},
		{
			"id":"520b351cdf235652",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\n描写胡逸民的神情。\n“胡兄作为一开始就跟随国民党的高管，\n不也为了兄弟舍弃一切进了监狱吗“\n方志敏掰开饼：“先吃，凉了就不好吃了。 自有人间真情在，干一个。”\n\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":114,
			"y":100,
			"width":500,
			"height":180
		},
		{"id":"dea657d2a06d49a0","type":"text","text":"两个士兵贼眉鼠眼的中景别仰视镜头  眼睛睁大 贼笑","x":-610,"y":180,"width":200,"height":100,"color":"2"},
		{
			"id":"4509627cc6630f34",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"转到背后镜头，士兵搜索方志敏的身",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-316,
			"y":180,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{"id":"9889602b19ad5294","type":"file","file":"方.png","x":149,"y":-690,"width":400,"height":263},
		{
			"id":"ae3bc8ef91ea24ab",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"方：“你我 真的想争夺这高官厚禄吗？”",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":224,
			"y":-40,
			"width":260,
			"height":80,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"817f3eae63521f73",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"士兵：这个份量的“大官”身上一定有钱！",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-640,
			"y":40,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"c153b061d1cc1555",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"胡逸民笔挺坐着，干净整洁的囚服。像是跟老熟人聊天。胡逸民举着两个饼子 给一个给方。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-630,
			"y":-840,
			"width":320,
			"height":120
		},
		{"id":"dbedcd9852da42bc","type":"file","file":"方备份/Pasted image 20260728212409.png","x":-601,"y":-672,"width":400,"height":225},
		{
			"id":"5afa2a55f1f7718a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"两个人坐在草席床上，\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-160,
			"y":-720,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"6ff816df413d36d2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"方志敏：“高官厚禄吗“\n抬头\n\" 胡兄可知当晚我被捕之事？\"\n\n接清贫画面",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-186,
			"y":-280,
			"width":670,
			"height":122
		},
		{
			"id":"05096caffae3e86d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"胡逸民：“他们让我告诉你，只要肯写一份声明，家人，性命、高官、后路，都可以谈。”\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-410,
			"y":-400,
			"width":840,
			"height":80,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"002c13fd9f3c4603",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"士兵在搜摸 方志敏的身",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-316,
			"y":40,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		}
	],
